Added a new shooting animation for the sniper
Added the shotgun
Tweaked some gun statistics
Tweaked some animations
Bug fixes!
|2.14.2019
Fixed some minor bugs as well as improved the animations
The sniper now does 100 damage, and the AR does 12
The sniper now has 2 bullets per magazine, and a 3 second delay between firing
Added recoil
