|2.11.2019
You can no longer shoot yourself.
Added a dynamic crosshair.
Changed the way bullet spread works.
Adjusted the AK47's fire rate to better replicate the fire rate of a real AK47.
You can now tell when you actually hit someone.
Added bullet holes.
Added a quit button to the main menu.
Edited the Desert map.
|2.10.2019
Added bullet spread
Damage is now handled client-side
Fixed a bug where on player disconnect the disconnected player's avatar would still be left behind
Changed the spawnpoints on Desert to prevent spawnkilling
Added a trail to health loss
